I like ones, I don't like elegant ones.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.990
I like sort of like a fun sort of trashy-

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:31.080
- Like Golden Girls.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.180
- Like Golden Girls.

