00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.310
- I wrote "Little Miss Little Compton"

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:41.443
- It's so great.

00:03:42.319 --> 00:03:43.770
So "Little Miss Little Compton", a memoir.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:44.760
So I mean, what's it about?

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:45.650
Obviously its a memoir.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:46.960
- It's a memoir.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.290
It's a book, I grew up
in this little tiny town

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.940
called Little Compton, Rhode Island,

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.630
that's never even heard
of the real other Compton.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.810
I mean, it's like the tiniest, tiniest,

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.580
like lobstermen and fishermen,

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.850
