00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.670
- But I hear, this is unfortunate,

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.800
so your mama passed right
before the book came out.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:38.633
- She did.

00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:40.150
It was actually sort of bittersweet.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.770
You know, I've been trying
to sell this book for years

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.360
and she was so funny and so magical

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.370
and she died suddenly last March.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.203
- So sorry.

00:06:48.203 --> 00:06:50.860
- Oh my God, thank you but
like the gift of it was

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.680
I was on the way to the funeral

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.500
